msgstr "ឈ្មោះ​ក្រុម​ពុម្ពអក្សរ ឧ. Sans, Helvetica, Times, Monospace"

#: gtk/gtkcellrenderertext.c:385 gtk/gtkcellrenderertext.c:386
#: gtk/gtktexttag.c:349
